@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
title COLORS - Use Case Diagram

actor User
rectangle "COLORS web application" {
  usecase "Log in" as Login
  usecase "Add a color" as Add
  usecase "Search my colors" as Search
  usecase "Log out" as Logout
}
User -- Login
User -- Add
User -- Search
User -- Logout

note right of Login
  Enter an existing user's login and password.
  Success stores a browser cookie and opens color.html.
end note
note right of Add
  Normal UI precondition for adding, searching,
  and logging out: the user has logged in.
  Login is not repeated inside each operation.
end note
note right of Search
  Match color names containing the search text,
  restricted to the supplied userId.
end note
note bottom of Logout
  Clear browser user data and cookie;
  return to index.html.
end note
@enduml
